<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="upgrade-insecure-requests">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonical %>">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Local CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <link rel="preload" href="logo.png" as="image">

    <!-- Safari & Apple Specific Meta -->
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/logo.png">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a192f">

    <!-- Universal Social/Search Cards (Brave, Twitter, etc.) -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="<%= title %>">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="<%= description %>">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://pdftopractice.in/logo.png">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://pdftopractice.in/logo.png">


    <!-- Favicon & Icons -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon.png">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon.png">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/favicon.png">
</head>
<body class="dark: font-sans min-h-screen">
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-semibold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                <span>Back to Home</span>
            </a>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-sm font-semibold">
                <a href="https://t.me/PDFtoPractice" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#229ED9] hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12s5.37 12 12 12 12-5.37 12-12S18.63 0 12 0zm5.562 8.161c-.18.717-.962 4.084-1.362 5.752-.169.706-.433.943-.684.966-.547.05-1.002-.387-1.533-.735-.83-.544-1.301-.883-2.107-1.413-.93-.614-.327-.951.203-1.503.138-.144 2.535-2.324 2.582-2.523.006-.025.01-.119-.045-.168s-.136-.032-.195-.019c-.083.018-1.408.895-3.974 2.628-.376.258-.717.385-1.022.378-.337-.008-.985-.191-1.467-.348-.592-.192-1.062-.294-1.021-.621.021-.17.256-.345.704-.524 2.766-1.204 4.61-1.998 5.534-2.383 2.637-1.099 3.183-1.29 3.539-1.296.078-.001.253.018.366.11.096.078.123.184.135.258.012.075.027.243.014.408z"/></svg>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">Telegram</span>
                </a>
                <a href="mailto:support@pdftopractice.in" class="text-amber-600 hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">Email</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-5 5v-5z"></path></svg>
                    <span>Contact Us</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-8 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-lg dark: space-y-6">
            <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 2026</p>
            <p>Welcome to the PDF to PRACTICE. Your privacy is critically important to us.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark: mt-8 mb-4">1. Data Collection</h2>
            <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg">
                <p class="font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300 mb-0">We DO NOT collect, store, or transmit ANY of your personal data or uploaded files.</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4">This application is entirely client-side. When you upload a PDF (like a DPP or PYQ), the file is processed <strong>locally within your web browser</strong> on your device. We do not have servers that receive your documents, and we do not track your practice scores or history.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark: mt-8 mb-4">2. Local Storage</h2>
            <p>We use your browser's LocalStorage and IndexedDB to save your theme preferences (Light/Dark mode) and your practice history (e.g., bookmarks, recent sessions, notes) so you can resume them later. This data remains on your device and is never sent to us or any third party.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark: mt-8 mb-4">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>We use third-party CDNs (like Cloudflare and jsDelivr) to serve essential libraries (like PDF.js and Tailwind CSS). These providers may collect basic connection information (like IP addresses) as part of their standard web serving logs.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark: mt-8 mb-4">4. Changes to this Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Since we don't collect your email address, we encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
